.TH OMORFOS\-WELCOME 1 "" omorfos "omorfos manual"
.nh
.ad l
.ds AD l
.SH NAME
omorfos\-welcome \- The welcome card of the omorfos desktop: the keys that matter, a wallpaper, and light or dark
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-welcome [\-\-first]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The omorfos compositor starts it with \-\-first each time it starts, and without when Welcome is chosen from the menu. Each choice is saved to config.yaml as it is made, the rest of the file kept as it is written.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-first\fR
Show the card only if it has not been closed before, as at a login
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print this help
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print the version
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBomorfos\fR(1), \fBomorfosctl\fR(1), \fBomorfos\-config\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-keys\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-rules\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-menu\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-theme\fR(5)
